{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0423"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/painting","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/art__painting.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",259],["+"," He spent his last years in his birthplace, Figueres in Catalonia, inside the Teatre-Museu Dalí he had built from the town's burnt-out theatre, and when he died on 23 January 1989 he was buried in the crypt beneath its stage, so that the region that formed him also keeps his body."],["=",438]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",269],["+"," Seine letzten Jahre verbrachte er in seiner Geburtsstadt Figueres in Katalonien, im Teatre-Museu Dalí, das er aus dem ausgebrannten Stadttheater geschaffen hatte, und als er am 23. Januar 1989 starb, wurde er in der Krypta unter dessen Bühne beigesetzt, sodass die Region, die ihn geprägt hatte, auch seinen Leichnam bewahrt."],["=",456]]}]},
